          "body": "Done — the on-screen keyboard is gone. I removed the whole keypad block from `pages/SMS.tsx` (the digit rows, the delete key and this image), its `.keyboard`/`.key*`/`.deleteGlyph` rules from `pages/SMS.module.css`, and the now-unused `deleteKeyImage` import. The screen is now just the sheet header, the title, the \"sent via\" line, the six code inputs and the resend timer.\n\nOne consequence to flag: the Figma frame this screen is measured against (node 2:2176) does include the keyboard across its bottom ~318px, so `studio_compare` against the registered \"SMS — Figma\" reference will now report that band as a difference. Say the word if you'd rather I put it back, or re-register the reference from a keyboard-less export.",
