            "displayName": "Studio agent",
            "kind": "agent"
          },
          "body": "Fixed. The three alternative sign-in buttons were rendering as bare inline pills — no full width and no outline — because their rules were also written as `:global(.btn)` and were dropped. Each now carries its class on the `Button` itself: `.outlineButton` (email, Google) sets `width: 100%` plus a 1px `--border-secondary-default` inset ring, and `.appleButton` sets the same width with a black `--background-brand-apple` ring and re-points `--text-link-default` to `--text-base-default` for the black label. All three keep `size=\"default\"`, so they are the design's 48px tall × 361px wide.",
